  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mission the Democratic Republic of the Congo mining week</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this mission is to raise awareness on the opportunities in the Congolese mining sector and on the Dutch services and solutions relevant for making this sector more sustainable and future proof, to facilitate new contacts, resulting in new partnerships, projects and business. The long-term goal is to contribute to the sustainability and development of the Congolese mining value chains, leveraging Dutch expertise and skills.</narrative>
  </description>
